#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/giflib.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>giflib</application> package contains libraries for reading"
" and writing GIFs as well as programs for converting and working with GIF "
"files."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>giflib</application> contém bibliotecas para ler e "
"escrever \"GIFs\", bem como aplicativos para converter e trabalhar com "
"arquivos \"GIF\"."

